<title>USA: Harold's Stores sets 5 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Harold's Stores sets 5 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NORMAN, Okla. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harold's Stores Inc said it will pay a 5 percent stock dividend on January 31 to shareholders of record January 17.</p>
<p>The company's shareholders will get one Harold's share for each twenty they own.</p>
<p>As of November 2, the company had about 5.43 million shares outstanding.</p>
